2. Third-party software in the MCP pack archives

   The pack archives (zip files) built from packs/ are not stored in this
   repository. Each one bundles an MCP server published by AWS Labs
   (https://github.com/awslabs/mcp) together with its Python dependencies, at
   the versions and hashes pinned in the pack's requirements.lock:

     packs/aws-pricing      awslabs.aws-pricing-mcp-server
     packs/aws-billing      awslabs.billing-cost-management-mcp-server
     packs/aws-cloudwatch   awslabs.cloudwatch-mcp-server

   The AWS Labs MCP servers are Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates and
   licensed under the Apache License 2.0. Their dependencies keep their own
   licenses. Each archive keeps the metadata directory (*.dist-info) of every
   distribution it bundles, with the license files that distribution ships.

3. Development and runtime dependencies

   Dependencies are not vendored. They are resolved from uv.lock and
